\title{bbsrgeo: Access and Convert BBSR Area Crosswalks for German Regional Statistics}
\description{
Tools to download and read the area crosswalks ('Umstiegsschluessel') for municipalities and districts published by the BBSR (Bundesinstitut fuer Bau-, Stadt- und Raumforschung, Germany's Federal Institute for Research on Building, Urban Affairs and Spatial Development), and to convert German regional statistics time series from the Regionaldatenbank Deutschland (GENESIS-Regio) onto a consistent set of area boundaries. Includes two example datasets, 'popregio' (derived from the Regionaldatenbank Deutschland) and 'popinkar' (derived from INKAR, an independent BBSR data product, used to validate the conversion), both licensed under the 'Datenlizenz Deutschland - Namensnennung - Version 2.0' ('dl-de/by-2-0'); see ?popregio and ?popinkar for the required attribution.
